    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/6bb63a3107a7f4beb165ae109988cb60.poster.avif?t=1744732153\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/6bb63a3107a7f4beb165ae109988cb60.webm?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/6bb63a3107a7f4beb165ae109988cb60.mp4?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i>Welcome, seeker!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Few reach this island. A handful is allowed to stay.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>On the surface, the place looks serene, but taking a closer look you\u2019ll notice that vibrant energy permeates its every corner. Magic? Yes, but of a special kind.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/834d5cab11e034a8a34347e722cb27ce.poster.avif?t=1744732153\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/834d5cab11e034a8a34347e722cb27ce.webm?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/834d5cab11e034a8a34347e722cb27ce.mp4?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It's Eromancy, the occult discipline that shall make you discover your partners' deepest desires and bend them at your will. Once you learn its ways, you will be ready to share more than a nightstand with your chosen ones. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/da6e82446f18cfdb695dd893c44ab5e3.avif?t=1744732153\" /></span>We find special pride in knowing that Soulgasm shall be your first time using the longing forces of seduction as a key component of the gameplay. These forces are yours to be discovered!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn Eromancy, explore the Palace, build relationships, solve the riddles, and find out what the hell is up with this House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/519f77f3bc4fb4c3c4634c0836854be2.poster.avif?t=1744732153\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/519f77f3bc4fb4c3c4634c0836854be2.webm?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2414440/extras/519f77f3bc4fb4c3c4634c0836854be2.mp4?t=1744732153\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play Soulgasm! - an Erotic Fantasy Adventure Dating Game! It is more than a visual novel, where the romance part is highly interactive and your decisions matter. A pie of comedy and drama with a fresh bit of mystery on top in the very special fantasy world we have brewed for you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unmatched art and interactions. <br>-<i>'We are downright proud of what we are doing'</i>\ud83c\udfa8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Immersive interactive sex animations. <br>-<i>...controlling the thrust speed alone isn't enough! </i>\u2728</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Anti-grinding super duper ethics. <br>-<i>'No grinding required, just sink into the story!'</i>\ud83c\udf7b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Witty writing. <br>-<i>'Because the pen is mightier than the sword.'</i>\u270d\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Characters hard not to fall in love with <br>-<i>'9 unique charming ladies to... you know ;)'</i>\ud83d\udc96</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A game about choices. <br>- <i>'Make decisions and live with the consequences!'</i>\ud83d\udcad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eerie rituals. <br>- <i>'You will feel that there is something they\u2019re not telling you. And you might be just right.'</i>\ud83e\udd2b</p></li></ul>",
