e the pen is mightier than the sword.'</i>\u270d\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Characters hard not to fall in love with <br>-<i>'9 unique charming ladies to... you know ;)'</i>\ud83d\udc96</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A game about choices. <br>- <i>'Make decisions and live with the consequences!'</i>\ud83d\udcad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Eerie rituals. <br>- <i>'You will feel that there is something they\u2019re not telling you. And you might be just right.'</i>\ud83e\udd2b</p></li></ul>",
